234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The TB-GOBRA - Team Building for green organisational behaviour in rural areas project was born from a shared belief that sustainability and collaboration are deeply interconnected. By combining creativity, teamwork, and environmental awareness, the project has provided adult learners and educators with new ways to build skills that are both practical and meaningful.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
235 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E <>
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
236 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Impact Studies and Mini-Research Report represent the final phase of this journey. This publication gathers both quantitative data and qualitative insights collected during the piloting of our methodology in Finland and Italy. It aims to assess how effectively the TB-GOBRA approach fosters teamwork, environmental awareness, and inclusion within vocational and adult learning contexts.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (By presenting evidence-based results and reflections from trainers and participants, this report serves not only as a validation of our work but also as a tool for educators, VET centers, and community organizations wishing to implement sustainable team-building in their own contexts.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
238 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We hope that these findings inspire others to integrate creativity, green practices, and collaboration into their teaching and training activities helping to build more connected, conscious, and resilient learning communities across Europe.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
