<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This four-day series of workshops was a great opportunity for me to connect with the culture of Finnish Lapland. Amid the more serious, academic courses of the first semester, these hands-on workshops and the discussions around food, which are so tied to everyday life, gave my brain a chance to rest. It was refreshing to chat with classmates and other participants in both indoor and outdoor Finnish-inspired spaces, or just listen quietly to their personal stories and ideas. This balance of work and rest, switching between indoor and outdoor activities, was exactly the kind of teaching approach I had imagined - and hoped for - in Finland. I really hope I get the chance to take part in more workshops like this in the future.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
