/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Even though I never made an actual menu, I found the first part of the workshop very interesting. Learning about which aspects have the most impact on our decision making when grocery shopping and overall food consumption and what kind of neuroscience have been made concerning that topic, really opened my eyes. How can it be, we prefer unhealthy and unsustainable food over both healthy and sustainable one just because of appearance and taste? Even though it was an interesting topic, it would have been nice to have more exchange and interaction between us participants. I had a lot of thoughts and ideas concerning this topic myself, but never had a chance to share them. Again, there was not enough time.)
