/E (The feedback on the Bike Felting workshop highlights its collaborative and hands-on nature, fostering a sense of community and teamwork among participants. Many appreciated the opportunity to learn about the felting process using organic materials, emphasizing sustainability and traditional techniques. The outdoor setting and group dynamics were appreciated for their engaging and refreshing atmosphere, sparking conversations and connections between participants from diverse backgrounds.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
