/E (However, some suggested improvements included providing clearer workshop descriptions to set expectations and ensuring more balanced participation to keep everyone actively involved. A few participants noted challenges, such as waiting periods and unclear roles, which could be addressed by dividing tasks or forming smaller groups. Despite minor issues, the workshop was widely regarded as enjoyable, educational, and impactful, blending creativity, tradition, and collaboration effectively.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
