/E (Working outdoors on the bike felting project was refreshing. I was involved in rolling the wool, and seeing it transform into a felt piece was engaging. The collaborative atmosphere encouraged us to share stories and learn from each other. Using natural materials highlighted the simplicity and importance of sustainability in a hands-on way.)
