/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In this workshop we crafted Himmelis. This time, we had more time for crafting, which was very much needed. Thinking about team building and creative work, the workshop would have needed more structure to get the participants into working in a team. I thought, for example, that everybody could have made one piece of one big Himmeli. Somehow, with a lot of creativity, we would have managed to get all the small crafts together into one big Himmeli. It would have forced us to talk and work together and create solutions. All in all, I did enjoy crafting my first ever Himmeli and I see a lot of potential in the idea of developing team building with focus on a more sustainable future.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [0]
