/E (oI ill Sunday\), and it proved to be joint favourite with the blanket embroidery. I enjoyed learning about how the reeds have to be soaked to be used and how families would make these decorations every year for Christmas. These decorations are very similar in style to some of the traditional German ornaments as they both use natural materials and red thread, so I was definitely inspired to have a go at making these back home for Christmas to decorate my own house. I appreciated how, in the workshop, there was the ability to follow the instructions of an example version or just have a go at experimenting and creating your own. The availability of a range of materials to use for the straws was also really clever and made the workshop much more approachable and accessible for everyone.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [7]
>>
