<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This too was a beginner friendly workshop and we were divided into groups of three. And then people started the mandala with their own ideas and then we had to switch the mandal between the group and the next person did the continuation of the mandala. There was input, colors and design related, there were new ideas and also there was natural talk within the group about different things. In the end we could take the mandala or let it be with the workshop for display. )
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [5]
>>
