/E (This workshop was a very enjoyable experience and I learnt a new craft which I had not tried before. The process of felting was quite relaxing and the facilitators were around to help answer any questions about the felting. I really enjoyed it when we took our mushrooms outside for a photo and saw them altogether. All the participants were visibly happy with their mushrooms and discussing the felting technique and how they found it. One piece of feedback would be to include more instruction at the start for those who never felt before to ensure that they understand the technique correctly.)
