/E (In the Mushroom Felting workshop, which was the last workshop, the fatigue of the participants started to show a little through the argumentation. Needle felting at the tables sparked a discussion among the felters about music, their own culture, food and how sharp the felting needles were. We felt success, when the wool began to resemble the shape of a mushroom. Creating a mushroom army under the birches crowned the end of the workshop.)
