/E (I especially loved how one of my classmates suggested that we place all the felted mushrooms we made around a big tree outdoors. We ended up gathering around the tree like the mushrooms we had made and took a group photo. My mood at that moment was as bright as the weather. This workshop also made me realize that I tend to follow my inner visions when I create.)
